V6 imports Paseo's Claude provider and its full dependency closure into src/agent/providers/ and src/agent/paseo/ from the same pinned commit. This includes the complete AgentClient and AgentSession contracts, protocol modules, shared helpers, and two plugin process launcher files. src/agent/paseo/closure.json records source paths, pinned SHA-256 values, destinations, exclusions, and modification reasons. The copied files retain upstream headers; modified files identify their Vonvon Bot adaptations. The plugin process launcher files retain their pinned bytes. The session-backend adapter is original Vonvon Bot integration code.

V7 imports additional provider sources and their required test and utility closure from the same pinned Paseo commit. Import paths are relocated. The Pi extension registry and OpenCode bridge have the two documented logic adaptations; other compiler compatibility changes are type-only. The file inventory, modification notices, diagnostic ownership and hashes are recorded in packages/daemon/src/agent/paseo/closure.json.
